  entries:
  - speakerName: Nexus
    portrait: {fileID: 4329407632164072968, guid: 768fe4dd8c6c4b24f99cb3ea39d88b98, type: 3}
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueText: Analysis complete. Our terraforming emissions are directly provoking the indigenous population. The more we reshape this environment, the more aggressively they resist.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Kyra-Dominia
    portrait: {fileID: 4329407632164072968, guid: ec3af396638fb02499ed390d58ca0309, type: 3}
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueText: The whole point is to reshape this environment. We do not stop. Push output, reinforce defenses, and hold the line.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Nexus
    portrait: {fileID: 4329407632164072968, guid: 768fe4dd8c6c4b24f99cb3ea39d88b98, type: 3}
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueText: Understood. Monitoring terraforming levels. Expect escalating hostility with each expansion cycle.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
